      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0411.sphattomene.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0411_sphattomene">
        <head>ΣΦΑΤΤΟΜΕΝΗ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-unnumbered">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-unnumbered-l1">Καλῶ δ᾽ Ἄρη Νίκην τ᾽ ἐπ᾽ ἐξόδοις ἐμαῖς,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-unnumbered-l2">καλῶ δὲ Χαιρεφῶντα· κἂν γὰρ μὴ καλῶ,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-unnumbered-l3">ἄκλητος ἥξει.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Athenaeus VI p. 243 e: Ἀπολλόδωρος δ᾽ ὁ Καρύστιος (μνημονεύει τοῦ Χαιρεφῶντος) — ἐν Σφαττομένῃ <quote>Καλῶ κτλ.</quote>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 Ἄρη Dindorfius. Libri Ἄρην. Ibidem ἐπ᾽ ἐξόδοις ἐμαῖς bene Schweigh. interpretatur de sacrificio et epulo profectionis causa ad bellum celebrato.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-5">
          <head>ΣΦΑΤΤΟΜΕΝΗ</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-5-l1">Martem et Vicepotam sacrum ad hoc propter viam</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-5-l2">voco: Chaerephontem simitu: nam pol ni vocem,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0411-sphattomene-5-l3">vel non vocatus adsit.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
